.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH discipline 1  "discipline 0.6.0" 
.SH NAME
discipline \- Universal CI/CD gatekeeper and AI coding agent diff sentinel
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdiscipline\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Universal CI/CD gatekeeper and AI coding agent diff sentinel
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
discipline\-check(1)
Run the configured gates. Exit 0 = pass, 1 = violations, 2 = could not check
.TP
discipline\-diff(1)
Shorthand for checking uncommitted or working tree changes against HEAD
.TP
discipline\-baseline(1)
Record or manage grandfathered finding baselines
.TP
discipline\-init(1)
Write a discipline.toml with every available gate at its default
.TP
discipline\-gates(1)
List every gate: id, suite, availability, and effective state
.TP
discipline\-schema(1)
Print the JSON Schema for discipline.toml
.TP
discipline\-self\-test(1)
Run the embedded negative / positive controls against this binary
.TP
discipline\-completions(1)
Generate shell completion script to stdout (bash, zsh, fish, powershell, elvish)
.TP
discipline\-install\-hooks(1)
Install pre\-commit hook in the local git repository
.TP
discipline\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
v0.6.0
